Ammo.js: the Bullet physics library compiled to WebAssembly (https://github.com/kripken/ammo.js).
This build (ammo.wasm.js, ammo.wasm.wasm) is the one in PlayCanvas's engine repository,
examples/assets/wasm/ammo (github.com/playcanvas/engine at 26c43e1, 2.25.0-beta.16).

